<section id="contribute" class="about-contribute">
<div class="wrap about-contribute-inner">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
<h2>Help expand the documentary record.</h2>
<p>Galapagensis welcomes identifications of people or places, oral testimony, family photographs, documentary leads, corrections, contextual information, translations, transcriptions, bibliographic references, archaeological information, and institutional collaboration.</p>
<p>Contributing information does not imply automatic publication. Rights, consent, provenance, access conditions, and verification remain part of the research process.</p>
</div>
<a class="about-action" href="/about/#contact">Contribute to Galapagensis</a>
</div>
