<p class="eyebrow">Credits</p>
<h2>Credits and acknowledgements</h2>
<p>Galapagensis is an independent research programme, but its work depends upon the institutions, repositories, communities, researchers, families, and individuals who preserve documentary traces, make collections accessible, share knowledge, answer questions, identify people and places, and contribute evidence to ongoing research.</p>
<p>Specific sources, collections, contributions, collaborations, and permissions are credited where they are used.</p>
</article>

